<title>USA: AMEX to list Centennial Tech options Dec 4.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Centennial Tech options Dec 4.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Monday it will list options on Centennial Technologies Inc on December 4.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will have opening strike prices of 30, 35 and 40, with initial expirations in December, January, April and July. The stock was up 1-7/8 at 37-1/2 by late morning Monday.</p>
<p>AGS Specialist Partners will be the specialist unit for the options, the AMEX said.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
